==================================================
执行连接创建查询
--------------------------------------------------
CQL语句:
MATCH (p1:V_Terminal {FTID: $point1_id}), (p2:V_Terminal {FTID: $point2_id})
            MERGE (p1)-[r1:CONN {
                voltage: 24.0,
                current: 0.1,
                resistance: 240.0,
                isCable: false,
                isInPanel: true,
                connType: 'devInConn'
            }]->(p2)
            MERGE (p2)-[r2:CONN {
                voltage: 24.0,
                current: 0.1,
                resistance: 240.0,
                isCable: false,
                isInPanel: true,
                connType: 'devInConn'
            }]->(p1)
            RETURN COUNT(r1) + COUNT(r2) as count
--------------------------------------------------
参数:
  point1_id: =A01+K1.B1-K3:A1
  point2_id: =A01+K1.B1-K3:A2
  连接属性:
    voltage: 24.0
    current: 0.1
    resistance: 240.0
    isCable: False
    isInPanel: True
    connType: devInConn
